.SH "struct pdg::SpriteTriggerEvent"
.PP 
Payload for an authored Spriter trigger delivered as eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\&. 

The common JavaScript payload contains:

.PP
Field  Meaning  \fRemitter\fP  Event emitter delivering the notification  \fReventType\fP  \fBpdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\fP  \fRactingSprite\fP  Sprite whose animation crossed the trigger  \fRinLayer\fP  SpriteLayer containing that Sprite  \fRtriggerName\fP  Authored eventline name  \fRclipName\fP  Clip containing the eventline key  \fRentityName\fP  Spriter entity containing the clip  \fRtimeSeconds\fP  Authored key position from clip start, in floating-point seconds  \fRoffsetSeconds\fP  Occurrence offset from the start of the update, in floating-point seconds  

.PP
Subscribe by event type and inspect \fRtriggerName\fP to distinguish authored triggers\&. An \fRaction\fP field is not a portable trigger discriminator\&. The native compatibility field \fRframeTime\fP uses integer milliseconds and is omitted from JavaScript\&. The native event ID is currently exposed by the browser bridge but not the V8/JavaScriptCore bridges\&.

.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBpdg::Sprite::enableSpriterEvents\fP 

.PP
\fBpdg::eventType_SpriteTriggerEvent\fP 

.PP
\fBAuthored Spriter triggers\fP 
.RE
.PP

